w towns were built, Bauchi, Ja-lingo and Yola to name but three, all of which grew into large cosmopolitan settlements which drew traders, artisans and peasant cultivators from all over their respective regions.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1339, 'temperature': 0.2})
